Jimmy, drop the fucking gun!
ໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍເຫັນມືຂອງທ່ານ! ຈິມມີ, ຖິ້ມປືນ!

1770
02:09:17,568 --> 02:09:20,322
I'm not playing with you, Jimmy!
I'll blast your fucking head off!
